# size 20x5
# Resizing while a full-screen program owns the terminal, then leaving it.
#
# This is the case that had no way of being written before, and the bug it covers was real: the
# hidden primary buffer was being truncated the moment the window changed, so the shell's screen
# came back with the middle cut out of its lines. Short lines again, so reflow is not in question.
\e[H\e[2Jshell-one\r\nshell-two\r\nshell-three
\e[?1049h\e[H\e[2Jfullscreen-app
# resize 12x4
\e[?1049l
